  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞阴影的气息稍微减弱了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞决定在这里休息……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}小虎～过来～\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}汪呜。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}这孩子好聪明啊！\n我家的小穆，\n整天就知道流口水！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}汪！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}它似乎很喜欢千枝。\n说还想让你摸摸头。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}……难道你能听懂狗的话？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}虽然不是语言，\n但可以互相传达意思。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 05 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}好厉害的功能！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}诶？\n养狗的人都能听懂吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}我家小穆说什么，\n我全都知道。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:9:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 01 FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}它老是说“给我吃肉”，\n还有“麻烦来块带骨头的”。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 11 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}绝对翻译错了吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}它也听得懂我的问题哦？\n问它“牛肉还是鸡肉？”，\n它就会回答“汪”！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}你这问题就不对吧。\n话说，怎么全都跟肉有关啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}都说狗会像主人嘛。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}要说自带“肉语翻译器”的，\n我们这边也有一个。\n喏，在那儿。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}真是的……这里没有海牛吗！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}……你说的是牛肉饭店“海牛”？\n怎么可能有。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}可恶……\n今天可是特制牛肉饭日啊……！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}看吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}啊……彼此彼此啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0F 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 17 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}特制牛肉饭……你说什么？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 18 01}口水，口水！\n真是的，天城，你也说说她啊？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 06 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 19 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}千枝家的狗，不是叫小穆，\n而是叫长宗我部吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:22:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1A 01}又养了一只吗？\n那我觉得叫幸村不错。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 32 01}你根本没在听啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 02 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1C 01}为什么要起武将的名字……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 12 01 03 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1D 01}汪！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_070.bf.json:26:0",
